50 725 m 550 725 l S
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 700 Td (4.1 The Need for Grounded Navigation) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 684 Td (Providing an answer without source verification degrades user trust. Modern AI assistants) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 668 Td (must provide deep navigation links that instantly transport users to the exact document,) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 652 Td (chapter, section, and page containing the supporting evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 624 Td (4.2 Dynamic Chunk Highlighting) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 608 Td (When a user clicks a citation badge \(e.g. Page 4, Section 4.1\), the document viewer should) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 592 Td (auto-scroll to the target page and highlight the matching chunk with an accent glow.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 576 Td (This visual feedback loop cuts verification time by over 80%.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 548 Td (4.3 Outline and Chapter Browsing) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 532 Td (Extracting the document's Table of Contents allows users to browse hierarchical chapters) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 516 Td (and scope their questions to specific sections of interest.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 270 30 Td (Page 1 of 5 - RAG Architecture Guide) Tj ET
