BT /F2 11 Tf 50 700 Td (5.1 RAG Triad Metrics) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 684 Td (Modern RAG evaluation frameworks measure three core axes: Context Relevance \(how well the) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 668 Td (retrieved chunks match the prompt\), Groundedness \(faithfulness of the answer to context\),) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 652 Td (and Answer Relevance \(how directly the synthesis satisfies the user's question\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 624 Td (5.2 Conversational Memory and Contextual Query Rewriting) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 608 Td (Multi-turn dialogues require tracking conversation state. Follow-up queries like 'explain its) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 592 Td (second limitation' are contextualized with conversation history before vector lookup.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 564 Td (5.3 Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 548 Td (RAG with interactive navigation represents the gold standard for reliable, auditable,) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 532 Td (and user-centric AI document intelligence.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 270 30 Td (Page 1 of 5 - RAG Architecture Guide) Tj ET
